Run a real Windows Vulkan editor executable with validation and synchronization validation. Each action emits identity JSON, ordered action log, UI state JSON, selection/document/runtime/history digest, PNG, and the required single markers. PNG-only evidence is insufficient (`gltf-scene-editor-parity-task.md:1043-1053`).

