9. Logs contain zero VUID, synchronization hazard, assertion, crash, or device-lost marker.

Reference/MGIF theme pixels need not be identical. Only approved MGIF theme-token differences are allowed; axis X/Y/Z semantics, geometry, state, depth behavior, and interaction result remain exact.

